{"data": [{"created_at": "2026-10-27T12:57:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115065400442728814"], "id": "2115065400442728814", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 574, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115039161308852364", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "分享完百度的 Unlimited OCR 2 模型后，陆续看到了一些关于它的分享，而且还是标注了「Paid Membership」的。。\n\n好吧，我叕一次没接到商务 哈哈，纯自来水分享。\n\n百度在 GenAI 之前，不管是 OCR 还是 ASR TTS 这些模型，Paddle 平台等，其实都还是做的很扎实的。只是在 GenAI 特别是 LLM https://t.co/9f4YsRoO8Y", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115065400442728814"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115048762389504001"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-27T11:51:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115048792483660088"], "id": "2115048792483660088", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 20, "impression_count": 1765, "like_count": 18, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 5}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114676494220013822", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "系列解读 Manus 联创张涛「用 Manus 改造 Manus，AI Native 组织改造的实践和思考」\n\n01 - 研发：AI 不只是助手，还能走完全流程\n\nManus-mono：给 AI 一张全栈地图\n传统产研团队的痛点普遍是前后端联调里人对不齐，不是写代码本身。Mono 没有把多仓揉成一个大仓，而做统一入口 + 给 AI https://t.co/Y4w6rQ5T10 https://t.co/eM5g2g3gfc", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115048792483660088"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-27T11:27:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115042592702505186"], "id": "2115042592702505186", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1286, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "想跟每天在我推文下面刷屏回复的各位机器人说两句我自己的感受。\n\n我不知道你们是听了哪位起号大佬的课，还是买了什么起号智能体，所以才会这么整齐划一的刷屏回复？", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115042592702505186"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115039144724545536"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-27T11:13:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115039161308852364"], "id": "2115039161308852364", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 1131, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114910381311512987", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "百度开源 Unlimited OCR 2：超长文档解析，注意力开销尽量不随页数涨\n\nUnlimited OCR 2 是面向「几十到几百页」文档的开源 OCR / 版面解析模型，3B/A0.5B 的 MoE 模型架构：用 SR-SWA https://t.co/Q6Lij1JPAL https://t.co/u78iLod6W4", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115039161308852364"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115036368825200640"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-27T11:02:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115036397799428313"], "id": "2115036397799428313", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 51, "impression_count": 2984, "like_count": 48, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 20, "retweet_count": 7}, "text": "Matt Pocock：AI 时代最该练的，是说清你在乎什么，并让代码库配得上 Agent\n\n来自 @nateherk 对 @mattpocockuk 44 分钟的访谈，Pocock 认为：最值钱的肯定不是追最新模型，是两件事：把你在乎什么说清楚，以及把测试、代码质量和流程做到 agent 能靠得住；他自己试了几个月 Spec https://t.co/ciIC2M8yh1", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115036397799428313"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115020402602983424"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-27T09:58:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115020426514469165"], "id": "2115020426514469165", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 22, "impression_count": 2255, "like_count": 17, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114975730471997613", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "[开源 Skills 推荐] skill-diet 给 Skill 减重：用评测保证「更瘦但不更差」\n\nskill-diet 是一个管其他 skill 的 meta-skill：一边把臃肿 SKILL.md 压薄并校对工具是否过时，一边给后续每次改 skill 立规矩；瘦身版只有在「旧 skill / 新 skill / 无 skill」同任务评测里至少不输才会留下。作者 https://t.co/dvMNYRZK5V https://t.co/8B5lLGeLHZ", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115020426514469165"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114919095137386496"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-27T03:16:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114919123281117195"], "id": "2114919123281117195", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 22, "impression_count": 2019, "like_count": 23, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 22, "retweet_count": 3}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114613174620061856", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "MiniMax 开源了自托管的 OpenAI Agents API「OpenAgentCore」：一套 Core，多种 Harness；官方 SDK 只改 OPENAI_BASE_URL，Session 里原生跑 Codex / Claude Code / MiniMax Code，模型与沙箱按协议可换\n\n开源地址：\nhttps://t.co/r4IpOu7och\n\n主要想解决的问题\n1. 同款 API：官方 OpenAI SDK 或裸 https://t.co/hh41dTFNtc https://t.co/K8MWMuivql", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114919123281117195"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114916399500214272"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-27T03:05:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114916415119770089"], "id": "2114916415119770089", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 9, "impression_count": 1102, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114743262565339148", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Mirendil 发布首个从零预训练的模型 Fern：把 10M token 当成另一种「算力」，服务「做 AI 的人」 @mirendil \nhttps://t.co/4VySmWhmq6\n\n10M Token 能做什么：~ 23 MB 代码 / ~50 万行，Megatron-LM 量级，或「几天 agent 干活」的轨迹一次塞进上下文。0.1 版只做了短轮 post-training；Mirendil https://t.co/i2dSKhJHYV https://t.co/hqiL7doB0J", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114916415119770089"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114912852142387200"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-27T02:51:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114912866709168259"], "id": "2114912866709168259", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 1154, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 15, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114696710173921589", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "阿里千问最新研究：Agent 也会「巴别塔」！\n\n团队发布一个新的 BabelArena 来测试：同一条 agent 工作流换语言后，工具调用、环境状态、检索与打分会不会一起走样，通关仍可能掩盖 8 倍级的工具调用膨胀。\n\n论文：https://t.co/XzxNUE9L1m\n\n千问帖子里的例子 https://t.co/spBsbwAXys https://t.co/2BWXKzN4PF", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114912866709168259"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114909075746258944"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-27T02:36:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114909091101573476"], "id": "2114909091101573476", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 916, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2095330467000328632", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "CS 329Z: Engineering AI Agents\nStanford / Fall 2026 @stanfordnlp\nhttps://t.co/XxgBNvYifv\n\n来到了第 10 课「Evaluating Agents — Terminal-Bench and Harbor」， @alexgshaw @ryan_marten 来分享Terminal-Bench 与 Harbor 怎么把 Agent 当成可迭代工程。\nhttps://t.co/5TFY7YaRGS https://t.co/ryDRkY5ZWJ https://t.co/vDSB2bYYS9", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114909091101573476"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114906775245983745"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-27T02:27:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114906791175971242"], "id": "2114906791175971242", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 34, "impression_count": 1895, "like_count": 26, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 14, "retweet_count": 7}, "text": "Uncle Bob 给 Agent 的精简纪律 Skills：先跑通，再做对，再养成习惯\n\nClean Code 作者 @unclebobmartin 开源的 Skills「ub-mode」，把经典 Clean Code / TDD 纪律沉淀为三段给 coding agent 用：先让它 work，再用 CRAP / 重复 / https://t.co/yWn8rMsxU9", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114906791175971242"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114708486131228672"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-26T13:19:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114708510525304915"], "id": "2114708510525304915", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 26, "impression_count": 2453, "like_count": 27, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 17, "retweet_count": 8}, "text": "304K ⭐️ Skills For Real Engineers @mattpocockuk \n111K ⭐️ Agent Skills @addyosmani\nCursor 官方插件 pstack @poteto \n\n三套 Agent Skill 怎么选：模糊对齐、全流程，还是证明它真的能跑 ？\n\n@robshocks 在他最新视频「Pocock vs Pstack vs Osmani: Which Skill Pack Wins?」中对这三套 Skills https://t.co/gq4SYoOj9z", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114708510525304915"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-26T13:00:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114703754327105573"], "id": "2114703754327105573", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2193, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "华为出身、打着华为终端案例出来做高端企业培训的那个团队，嗯，只能说，还是人家挣钱狠！\n\n也是很佩服前司这个项目的发起者，是怎么说服老板花几十人研发团队的年成本来请这个团队的？？！", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114703754327105573"}, {"article": {"title": "用 Manus 改造 Manus：AI Native 组织怎么边 dog fooding 边改进工作方式 "}, "created_at": "2026-10-26T11:12:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114676494220013822"], "id": "2114676494220013822", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 102, "impression_count": 12442, "like_count": 74, "quote_count": 7, "reply_count": 30, "retweet_count": 10}, "text": "来自 @ManusAI 联合创始人张涛 @hidecloud 发布在公众号的一篇文章「用 Manus 改造 Manus，AI Native 组织改造的实践和思考」，Agent 工程实践价值非常高，强烈推荐给各位 AI 开发者们。 https://t.co/xgJ53Xk6Pm", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114676494220013822"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114658381898420224", "3_2114658791459594240"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-26T10:09:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114660807523160065"], "id": "2114660807523160065", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 1599, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113839951557313003", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "首先：对不起 Lovart，我只是拿你来举个例子 😄\n\n之所以用 Lovart 主要是因为它的产品性质：PGC + UGC 的类社区和模板形态，用户使用的封面可能千差万别，有可能是几 KB 的模糊小图，也可能是几十 MB 的超清大图，几万 * 几万那种... https://t.co/Ps3NVYRI0O https://t.co/vt8P60AjLD", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114660807523160065"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114642369123651584"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-26T08:56:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114642398936502394"], "id": "2114642398936502394", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 1735, "like_count": 17, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 19, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "Graphify：整仓一次建知识图，少让 Agent 反复 grep\n\n@graphify 的做法：先整仓建持久知识图，再让 coding agent 查图改码，而不每轮任务从头 grep/瞎读文件；省 token、也少迷路；是否真能稳降 80% 花费等营销数字，要看仓规模、图是否保鲜，以及 agent 是否真接进图查询。 https://t.co/vKNfa4hhA6", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114642398936502394"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114640490532589568"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-26T08:49:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114640541816172747"], "id": "2114640541816172747", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 12, "impression_count": 2148, "like_count": 15, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114626630429913383", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "把代码库调教得更适合 Agent：类型反馈、Expect Test，以及正式方法新账本\n\n@poteto 推荐的 @yminsky 这场 Bug Bash 演讲，并点出几条她认为最值得带走的实战经验，用来把代码库本身改造成更利于 Agent 工作的环境，一起看看。\nhttps://t.co/38s5jMkwzZ\n\nAgent 让写代码变便宜之后，Jane Street https://t.co/jCerrw25hZ https://t.co/bL0tX3SF7k", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114640541816172747"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114615278965538816"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-26T07:09:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114615306908029337"], "id": "2114615306908029337", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 32, "impression_count": 3686, "like_count": 43, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 16, "retweet_count": 11}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114604912520921136", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Claude Code 怎么做 Code Review：把「有没有人读过」换成分层检查与快速回滚\n\n在「Claude 写约九成 Claude Code 代码、变更量暴涨」的前提下，团队没有取消 https://t.co/4MxaZIm3Gb https://t.co/rH1XfBEzsl", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114615306908029337"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114606351230124032"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-26T06:38:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114607626600525978"], "id": "2114607626600525978", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 2724, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113622461166313919", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "自从大一统的 X Subscription 推出，总感觉之前送的 Cursor Ultra 一年订阅，可能随时被强制升级 ...\n\nGrok Bot 这些天用的完全停不下来，基本上生活、学习和工作的东西都搬上来了，Cursor 和 Codex 也基本处于保号状态，打开越来越少了 ...\n\n今天有前同事咨询我订阅 Muse https://t.co/49BhYcZ1z4 https://t.co/6bW2wmtmzT", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114607626600525978"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-26T05:39:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114592628247568814"], "id": "2114592628247568814", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 3322, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113825585634168920", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "两年前「田柯宇训练投毒事件」亲历者、受害者的第一人称陈述，值得被看见！\n\n关于「训练投毒」的整体经过和客观事实，大家看晚点的报道和 @ShoufaChen 的内容原文，我就不过多解读了，我自己读完后，倒是对字节有一些新的感受。\n\n起家于头条，壮大于抖音，字节被人看到的一直都是一个「C 端 App https://t.co/ISp01B6qaP", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114592628247568814"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114569908713570304"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-26T04:09:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114569988870906111"], "id": "2114569988870906111", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 28, "impression_count": 2418, "like_count": 24, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 27, "retweet_count": 5}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114445139800461618", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Hassan 把他日常做应用的工作流公开了！\n\n语音 → 视觉参考 → 澄清问答 → v1 反馈 → 录屏验收 → 发帖或扔掉 的闭环；harness 混用 Claude Code（Opus 5.5 high） 与 OpenCode（DeepSeek V4.1 Flash / GLM 5.3），并给 Agent 接上部署/模型/设计类 CLI 与 skills。\n\n六步工作流\n· 用 @WisprFlow 录 https://t.co/EYlnGHjUMy https://t.co/PJwbR4lEiz", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114569988870906111"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114544653261586432"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-26T02:28:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114544704461373848"], "id": "2114544704461373848", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 40, "impression_count": 2805, "like_count": 45, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 13, "retweet_count": 10}, "text": "Company Harness 五件套：把公司级 Agent 做成可多人协作的基础设施\n\n@LangChain 用自家 GTM / 工程 / 营销三套内部 Agent 总结出「公司级 harness」的五块共性底座：住在人已在用的协作入口、身份（OBO vs 服务账号）分工具落地、全局/用户双层记忆、沙箱内跑代码并经 secret proxy https://t.co/zGJixPTfES", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114544704461373848"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114539817166114816"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-26T02:09:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114539832555065471"], "id": "2114539832555065471", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6